+- ERASE THE SD CARD ----------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                              |
| This erases everything on /dev/sdb (Sample 32 GB, 31.9 GB).                  |
| The camera is not touched. This cannot be undone.                            |
|                                                                              |
| Command:  mkfs.fat -F32 /dev/sdb1                                            |
|                                                                              |
| Erase the card?   ( ) Yes   (*) No                                           |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  y yes   n/Enter/Esc/q no
